('home', 'story', 'Our Story', 'A Journey of Healing, Growing with Every Patient', 'Chitrawan Nature Cure Hospital was born from a simple belief: true health comes from within. What began as a small clinic with two therapists has grown into a trusted wellness destination, guided every step of the way by the thousands of patients who trusted us with their care.

Every therapy we offer, every space we design, and every team member we welcome reflects the same promise — to treat you as family and walk beside you on your path to balance.', '12+ Years|Of natural healing', '/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1512621776951-a57141f2eefd.jpg', '', '/about', 'Read Our Full Story', '["Founded on natural, drug-free healing","Thousands of patients helped since 2010","A caring team that treats you like family"]'),
('home', 'cta', 'Start Your Journey', 'Ready to Begin Your Wellness Journey?', 'Book an appointment today and take the first step toward a healthier, more balanced you.', '', '', '', '', '', '["Book an Appointment|/contact|primary","View Tariff|/tariff|light"]'),
('about', 'hero', '', 'About Us', 'Meet the people and philosophy behind Chitrawan Nature Cure Hospital — where natural healing is a way of life.', '', '', '', '', '', '[]'),
('about', 'founder', '01 · Our Founders', 'Meet Our Founders', 'Dr. Rajesh Sharma established Chitrawan Nature Cure Hospital with the vision of creating a healthcare facility that promotes natural healing and healthy living. With more than twenty years of experience in holistic medicine, he believes prevention and lifestyle changes are the keys to long-term wellness.

His mission is to help people heal naturally and live healthier lives through personalized care and compassionate treatment.', 'Dr. Rajesh Sharma|Founder & Holistic Medicine Specialist', '/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d.jpg', '', '', '', '["Dr. Sunita Sharma|Co-Founder & Yoga Therapy Director|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1545205597-3d9d02c29597.jpg|Dr. Sunita Sharma co-founded Chitrawan Nature Cure Hospital with a vision of combining classical yoga therapy with modern natural medicine. She leads the yoga and mindfulness programs and has guided thousands of patients toward calmer, healthier lives."]'),
('about', 'approach', '02 · Our Approach', 'Treating the Root Cause', 'Our approach focuses on treating the root cause of diseases rather than simply managing symptoms. We believe true healing occurs when the body, mind, and spirit are in harmony.', '', '/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1544161515-4ab6ce6db874.jpg', '', '', '', '["Natural healing without harmful side effects","Prevention of disease through lifestyle change","Personalized care for every individual","Healthy nutrition as the foundation of health","Physical, mental, and emotional wellness"]'),
('about', 'doctors', '03 · Our Doctors', 'Our Doctors & Specialists', 'A multidisciplinary team working together for your complete care.', '', '', '', '', '', '["Dr. Meena Gurung|Naturopathy Specialist|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1543269865-cbf427effbad.jpg","Anil Thapa|Senior Physiotherapist|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b.jpg","Sita Adhikari|Yoga Therapist|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1512290923902-8a9f81dc236c.jpg","Nirmala K.C.|Nutritionist|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1498837167922-ddd27525d352.jpg","Prakash Shrestha|Wellness Consultant|/wellness/public/uploads/photos/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735.jpg"]'),
